- **Vị trí Frontend**: Trang `/admin/service-requests` ([ServiceRequestsPage.tsx](file:///c:/Users/BINH/Downloads/ki9/doan/demo/demo-capstone/frontend/src/pages/admin/ServiceRequestsPage.tsx)).
